OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be mainly dry. The rest of the
OL,7,Fnight will be largely dry with clear
OL,8,Fperiods and the odd shower across
OL,9,FDumfries and Galloway.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FA mostly dry day although
OL,12,Ffairly cloudy at times, some bright
OL,13,Fspells possible across the east. Brisk
OL,14,Fsouthwesterly winds across Edinburgh
OL,15,Fand Lothian.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,18,Fwith a chance of rain across the west
OL,19,Fand north on Saturday, east coast
OL,20,Fdrier. Patchy rain at first on Sunday
OL,21,Fotherwise dry. Dry on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
